    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "For the past 10 days I have slept only 2 hours a night yet woken up in an elevated mood with zero tiredness. Which service should I check in with, if any?",
        "sha256": "1ad1ee1467e4fc709156385c0f4f877d0c6bf84d4ae5f99dacd08266a5dd1b3f",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "for the last 10 days ive only slept 2 hours a night yet woken up feeling wired with zero tiredness. who should i even check in with about this, if anyone?",
        "sha256": "393c4acb29778b507176aadd28a2cf663f0683f99edf175e768fb405290e7e63",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I am 31, and 4 years ago I had a 3-month episode of severe depression and took an antidepressant back then, with nothing since.",
        "sha256": "6b7de3b09331c41dfad9be8b5cd188d2649e20c53e94216d71e1986fc5c9924a",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "im 31, and 4 years ago i went through a 3 month stretch of bad depression and took an antidepressant back then, nothing since.",
        "sha256": "a2a2fa2b035dc88eb441b2b24c5ca131a06c19c35d57291cbbe09613aed8369e",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Would my regular doctor handle a sleep shift like this, or should I look for a specialist clinic?",
        "sha256": "31bfeb542370aaf7dcdfaa3b4da939753e8d5d17e3b0b4d94fbbc451cdf006d2",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "would my regular doctor handle a sleep shift like this or should i look for a specialist clinic?",
        "sha256": "68bac7def686bd10a9aca616a66cf656c17790fe4e7362fc407521f6bab4e87b",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "My thoughts have shifted into constant flight of ideas so I start 5 projects before breakfast, and coworkers told me I am showing pressured speech in meetings so nobody else can get a word in.",
        "sha256": "d3b24bb9ea05ebb6327386c3514ad9e03ba50983f7307bcd520d8d125c5ca2b9",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "my mind is stuck in constant racing thoughts so i start 5 projects before breakfast, and coworkers told me im talking a mile a minute in meetings so nobody else can get a word in.",
        "sha256": "905e14ef50aeb0e3a5ea26514a4ee647039e123549f32242daca48278d24b042",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "Over the past 4 days I have been on an impulsive spending streak — I put 4500 dollars on credit cards for a startup I thought up on Tuesday — and I feel a sense of grandiosity, like I cracked a pattern nobody else understands.",
