        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "over the last 4 days ive gone on a spending spree, put 4500 dollars on credit cards for a startup i came up with on tuesday, and i feel totally invincible like i cracked a pattern nobody else gets.",
